    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d504">

                <pb facs="0572" n="560" sameAs="frus:frus1944v03/pg560"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">701.6260D/18: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Finland</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Gullion</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Helsinki</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-02-01T17:00:00+02:00">February 1, 1944—5
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received February 1—2:27 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>78. I am informed by a reliable diplomatic source that Blucher, German Minister,
                    has been called to confer with Hitler at his headquarters. <pb facs="0573"
                        n="561" xml:id="pg561"/> Blücher left here yesterday or the day before
                    accompanied by Metzger, German Press Attaché. I have not yet heard any
                    explanation of this visit.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Gullion</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
